 # Existing System Analysis

| Process | Existing (manual) system | Problem | eSmartLib solution |
|---|---|---|---|
| Borrowing/returning |Manual Input to the system | Slow, errors, no overdue tracking | QR scan, automatic due date, availability count |
| Attendance | Paper Log Book Manual| Hard to summarize | QR time-in/time-out + history |
| Book availability | Yes | Students cannot check/reserve | Online book requests |
| Reports | Yes | Time-consuming | Dashboard + history filters |
| Account/password help | N/A | — | Admin-issued reset code |
